### Signup author for post detail check
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "post-detail-author@example.com",
  "password": "password1234",
  "nickname": "postDetailAuthor"
}


### Login author for post detail check
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "post-detail-author@example.com",
  "password": "password1234"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("accessToken", response.body.data.accessToken);
%}


### Create post for detail check
POST http://localhost:8080/api/posts
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=post-detail-create-boundary
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

--post-detail-create-boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="categoryId"

1
--post-detail-create-boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="title"

Spring detail question
--post-detail-create-boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="content"

Post content for detail lookup.
--post-detail-create-boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="files"; filename="detail.png"
Content-Type: image/png

fake-png-content
--post-detail-create-boundary--

> {%
    client.global.set("postId", response.body.data.postId);
%}


### Detail post - success
GET http://localhost:8080/api/posts/{{postId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


